                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Over the next 30 days, millions of people across the country will face an impossible decision:\n\nForego health insurance or go into debt. \n\nIf Republicans don't extend health care tax credits by January 1, it will drive up costs for everyone. https://t.co/KGucKtKmLX",
