                "text": "Donald Trump keeps calling affordability a \u2018hoax\u2019.\n\nHe may not care about the rising costs of food, housing, energy, and health care, but the American people do. \n\nIt\u2019s no hoax when you can\u2019t pay your bills. https://t.co/U5yVXchUeN",
