                "text": "Nice try, Mr. President. Yell as you might, try and deny \u2014 but no one believes you. \n\nYour big ugly bill eliminated tax credits for health care and drove up prices. \n\nIf you weren\u2019t so focused on building ballrooms and cared about average families, you could have done something about it.",
